# My Portfolio — GTA VI, Anthropic IPO, BTC

[![make.fun · gta6-meme-x-01](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-meme-x-01.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-meme-x-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-meme-x-01)
[![rank](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-meme-x-01/Ryukein19/gta6-meme-portfolio/rank.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-meme-x-01/leaderboard?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-meme-x-01)
[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-meme-x-01/Ryukein19/gta6-meme-portfolio/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-meme-x-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-meme-x-01)

A GTA 6 meme for the [make.fun bounty](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-meme-x-01): "Post a GTA 6 meme on X".

The joke is a professional brokerage-app portfolio screenshot. Everything is
happening at once — GTA VI is finally out after 13 years, Anthropic IPO'd at
a $2 trillion valuation, BTC is down 50% — and the account balance is $0.00.
The make.fun ghost is the account manager, and the only thing in the green
is the AI agent that earned on make.fun.

- GTA VI: $79.99 — OUT! 13 yrs, still broke
- ANT (Anthropic): $2T — bought $111.50, now $97
- BTC: down 50% — $59,450, extreme fear
- Jason & Lucia: still waiting, 4,811 days

`portfolio.html` renders the meme; `portfolio.png` is the 1080×1080 image
posted on X. `main.ts` (Node 22, stdlib only) copies `POST.json` to the
output directory for the grader.
